 "add", "s": 67.7, "e": 67.909, "p": 9}, {"w": "software.", "s": 67.967, "e": 68.618, "p": 9}, {"w": "Maybe", "s": 68.652, "e": 68.885, "p": 9}, {"w": "you", "s": 68.931, "e": 69.012, "p": 9}, {"w": "want", "s": 69.082, "e": 69.245, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 69.268, "e": 69.314, "p": 9}, {"w": "use", "s": 69.372, "e": 69.523, "p": 9}, {"w": "AI", "s": 69.581, "e": 69.999, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 70.057, "e": 70.104, "p": 9}, {"w": "make", "s": 70.162, "e": 70.289, "p": 9}, {"w": "your", "s": 70.313, "e": 70.417, "p": 9}, {"w": "business", "s": 70.452, "e": 70.754, "p": 9}, {"w": "easier", "s": 70.812, "e": 71.137, "p": 9}, {"w": "to", "s": 71.207, "e": 71.265, "p": 9}, {"w": "run.", "s": 71.346, "e": 71.706, "p": 9}, {"w": "Come", "s": 72.006, "e": 72.227, "p": 10}, {"w": "inside,", "s": 72.261, "e": 72.761, "p": 10}, {"w": "find", "s": 72.807, "e": 73.016, "p": 10}, {"w": "your", "s": 73.063, "e": 73.167, "p": 10}, {"w": "starting", "s": 73.202, "e": 73.515, "p": 10}, {"w": "point,", "s": 73.562, "e": 73.829, "p": 10}, {"w": "and", "s": 73.852, "e": 73.945, "p": 10}, {"w": "start", "s": 74.015, "e": 74.305, "p": 10}, {"w": "building.", "s": 74.363, "e": 75.21, "p": 10}], "paras": [{"s": 0.6, "e": 7.102, "text": "Trying to build a business with AI right now can feel like trying to put together a puzzle while somebody keeps adding new pieces."}, {"s": 7.402, "e": 15.389, "text": "You've got GoHighLevel, Claude, app builders, AI agents, automations, and a new tool everybody says you need every week."}, {"s": 15.689, "e": 24.281, "text": "There's a lot of opportunity. But figuring out what to use, how it all connects, and what someone would actually pay you for gets complicated fast."}, {"s": 24.581, "e": 26.206, "text": "That's why I built this community."}, {"s": 26.506, "e": 35.005, "text": "This is where I share my strategies, skills, tools, and training for starting and growing an online business using AI, SaaS, and GoHighLevel."}, {"s": 35.305, "e": 40.924, "text": "We cover how to build something useful, package it into an offer, deliver it, and get customers."}, {"s": 41.224, "e": 50.605, "text": "You'll get practical training, downloadable skills, prompts, and resources you can use in your own business. You'll also have coaching and a place to bring questions as you work through it."}, {"s": 50.905, "e": 56.617, "text": "And as things change, you'll get exclusive drops, new training, and updates on what I'm building and testing."}, {"s": 56.917, "e": 63.186, "text": "The idea is that you can come here, understand your options, and choose a next step that makes sense for where you are."}, {"s": 63.486, "e": 71.706, "text": "Maybe you're starting with an idea. Maybe you've already got an agency and want to add software. Maybe you want to use AI to make your business easier to run."}, {"s": 72.006, "e": 75.21, "text": "Come inside, find your starting point, and start building."}]}